  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Isolated corridors in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work locally with the indigenous communities to raise awarness about isolated indigenous peoples, ensure sustainable management of the surrounding area as well as advocate for the creation of two isolated corridors. 
